                  {
                    "summary": [
                      "After his death, Basquiat's reputation as an important figure in modern art solidified. Exhibitions of his work have continued to draw interest, and his influence can be seen in the work of contemporary artists who cite his raw, emotive style and cultural commentary as an inspiration.",
                      "Epigrams - Brief, witty, and often paradoxical sayings"
